296.99\n\nAt Walmart\n\nIntel N100, 8GB DDR5, 2.5GbE, two NVMe slots. Excellent Plex hardware transcoding performance for the price. Plex setup through Docker requires some configuration.\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn277498product1\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\nBest connectivity and expandability\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn277498product1\",\"QNAP TS-264 2-Bay High-Performance Desktop NAS. Intel 4C/4T \u2026\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$489.00\n\nAt newegg.com\n\nIntel N5095, 8GB RAM, dual 2.5GbE, two NVMe slots, PCIe expansion. Good Plex transcoding and more connectivity than UGREEN.\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"Synology DiskStation DS224+ two bay NAS product white background\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\nBest software experience\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"product\",\"Synology DiskStation DS224+\",\"two-bay network attached storage\"]\ue201**\n\nTypical diskless price around \\$300\u2013\\$350; verify current stock.\n\nIntel J4125, 2GB RAM, dual 1GbE. Excellent DSM software, easy management and backups, but older hardware than UGREEN.\n\nPrices are retailer listings and can change. NAS enclosures above are diskless unless otherwise specified. Hardware and recommendations checked against current NAS comparisons. \ue200cite\ue202turn277498search4\ue202turn277498search5\ue202turn277498search6\ue201\n\n## Quick comparison\n\n| Feature | UGREEN DXP2800 | QNAP TS-264 | Synology DS224+ |\n|--------|--------|--------|--------|\n| CPU | Intel N100 | Intel N5095 | Intel J4125 |\n| RAM | 8GB | 8GB | 2GB |\n| Network | 2.5GbE | 2\u00d7 2.5GbE | 2\u00d7 1GbE |\n| NVMe slots | 2 | 2 | 0 |\n| Plex 4K transcoding | Very good | Good | Good, older hardware |\n| Ease of use | Good | Good | Excellent |"}],"c":11}     

